  </header> <section class="section" id="summary" aria-labelledby="summary-title">
    <h2 id="summary-title">Summary</h2>
    <div class="prose summary"><p>This PR adds automatic retries for webhook deliveries that fail with a 5xx status or a timeout. <code class="nowrap">deliverWebhook</code> now records each failed attempt in a new <code class="nowrap">webhook_retries</code> table. A new <code class="nowrap">retryWorker</code> job sends due retries again, up to 6 attempts.</p><p>Before this change, one failed request dropped the event. Customers then had to poll <code class="nowrap">/events</code> to recover. The PR also renames <code class="nowrap">http.ts</code> to <code class="nowrap">http-client.ts</code> and deletes the unused <code class="nowrap">legacy-sender.ts</code>.</p></div>
