                  <dd><code class="nowrap">deliverWebhook</code> now catches 5xx responses and timeouts and calls <code class="nowrap">scheduleRetry</code> with the attempt count. A new <code class="nowrap">computeBackoff(attempt)</code> returns the delay: 30 seconds doubled per attempt, capped at 1 hour.</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                        <dt>Why</dt>
                        <dd>This is the core behavior change. Failed deliveries are no longer dropped. Every caller of <code class="nowrap">deliverWebhook</code> now gets retries without code changes.</dd>
                      </div>
              </dl>
